#: ../../source/4-reference/descriptions/4-fiveages_umbrella.md:85
#: 4d9f00c9af574e1bac30a3c152ef39f3
msgid ""
"Checkout: standalone `git submodule update --init humanoid/FiveAges/Gen2`"
" (and `…/Gen1`) as in the [robot_usds README](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/robot_usds/blob/main/README.md) §2.1, or FaSim-Isaac "
"**`./init.sh`** (operation that inits `robots/` via "
"`submodules_visibility.conf`), then **`./run.sh`**. FaSim’s visibility "
"file still marks the FiveAges Gen\\* trees `private`, so `./init.sh` does"
" not select them by default. See "
"[robot_usds](../simulation/3-robot_usds.md)."
msgstr ""
"检出：按[robot_usds README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_usds/blob/main/README.md)§2.1 单独执行 `git submodule update --init"
" humanoid/FiveAges/Gen2`（以及 `…/Gen1`），或用 FaSim-Isaac 的 **`./init.sh`**（按 "
"`submodules_visibility.conf`初始化`robots/`的那一步），然后 **`./run.sh`**。FaSim "
"的可见性文件仍把 FiveAges Gen\\* 树标成 `private`，因此 `./init.sh`默认不会勾选它们。见 "
"[robot_usds](../simulation/3-robot_usds.md)。"

